/* -----------------------------------------------------------
   Credential “smoke‑test” script
   -----------------------------------------------------------
   Reads the values that you keep in .env.test (or any env) and
   performs a lightweight request for each service.

   • PostgreSQL – simple SELECT 1
   • AWS – STS GetCallerIdentity
   • Anthropic – a tiny /v1/models call
