| **Helmet** | added | Sets `Content‑Security‑Policy`, `X‑Frame‑Options`, `X‑Content-Type-Options`, etc. |
| **CORS** | added with explicit whitelist | Prevents unwanted origins from consuming the API. |
| **Rate limiting** | added | Thwarts brute‑force and basic DoS. |
