## 1️⃣ Baseline Hardening (security‑first defaults)

| Issue | Why it matters | Fix |
|-------|----------------|-----|
| No HTTP security headers | Browsers will accept the app with default, insecure headers (e.g., missing `X‑Content‑Type‑Options`, `X‑Frame‑Options`, CSP). | Install and use **helmet**: <br>`npm i helmet` <br>```js<br>const helmet = require('helmet');<br>app.use(helmet());``` |
